B.wE=new A.bk(B.SJ,["My Bikes","New Bike","Search brand or model...","No bikes found.","Add new Bike","Choose from Database","Pre-configured top models with suspension specs","Create manually","Enter brand, model, and travel yourself","New Bike","Add Cover Photo","Change Cover Photo","Brand","Model (Tap to search database)","e.g. Megatower","Category","Front Travel (mm)","Rear Travel (mm)","Save Bike","Specs applied for","!","New Setup","add new Setup","Configure Suspension","Rename","Duplicate","Delete Setup?","Do you really want to delete the setup ","? This action cannot be undone.","Bike not found","New Name","(Copy)","Front","Rear","details","Fork","Shock","Tires","Front tire model","Front tire pressure","Rear tire model","Rear tire pressure","History","Notes","General remarks (e.g., trail conditions, weather...)","No adjustments recorded yet.","New Value","Reason (Optional)","e.g. more support...","What is this?","Got it","Not set","Air","Setup name","e.g. Schladming","Please enter a name.","Create setup","FORK SETTINGS","SHOCK TYPE","SHOCK SETTINGS","TIRES","Main Air Pressure (PSI)","2nd Chamber / OTT (PSI/Clicks)","High-Speed Comp. (HSC)","Low-Speed Comp. (LSC)","High-Speed Rebound (HSR)","Low-Speed Rebound (LSR)","Tokens (Spacers)","Hydraulic Bottom-Out (HBO)","Air","Coil","Air Pressure (PSI)","Spring Rate (lbs/in)","Preload (Turns)","Track Tires & Pressure","Save Configuration","Save Changes","Edit Bike","Model","Delete Bike","Delete Bike?","Do you really want to delete this bike? All setups will be lost permanently.","Required","Error","Cancel","Save","Delete","Welcome to Bike Setup Tracker! \ud83d\udeb2","I have created a demo bike for you so you can try out the features right away.","IMPORTANT: You can edit or delete this demo (and any other bike) at any time by LONG-PRESSING the bike card on the home screen!","Let's go!"],t.li)
