B.RV=new A.bk(B.wY,["Low-Speed Compression: Kontrolliert das Einfedern bei langsamen Bewegungen (z. B. Wiegetritt, Bremsen, Anliegerkurven). Mehr LSC = mehr Gegenhalt, weniger = mehr Traktion.","High-Speed Compression: D\xe4mpft schnelle, harte Schl\xe4ge (z. B. Wurzelfelder, dicke Steine, harte Landungen).","Low-Speed Rebound: Regelt die Ausfedergeschwindigkeit nach normalen Bodenwellen. Zu schnell = Bike springt, zu langsam = Fahrwerk versackt.","High-Speed Rebound: Regelt das Ausfedern nach tiefen Kompressionen, damit das Heck bei Spr\xfcngen nicht kickt.",u.g,u.g,u.g,"Volume Spacers: Ver\xe4ndern die Endprogression. Mehr = h\xf6herer Durchschlagschutz.","Hydraulic Bottom-Out: Ein hydraulischer Durchschlagschutz am Ende des Federwegs.","Off The Top: Reguliert die Sensibilit\xe4t auf den allerersten Zentimetern des Federwegs.","Die H\xe4rte der Stahlfeder, passend zum Fahrergewicht gew\xe4hlt.","Vorspannung der Stahlfeder. Achtung: Nicht zur Sag-Einstellung nutzen (max. 2-3 Umdrehungen)!"],t.li)
B.wG=new A.bk(B.wY,["Low-Speed Compression: Controls compression during slow suspension movements (e.g. pedaling, braking, berms). More LSC = more support, less = more traction.","High-Speed Compression: Absorbs fast, harsh impacts (e.g. root sections, big rocks, hard landings).","Low-Speed Rebound: Controls the extension speed after normal bumps. Too fast = bike bounces, too slow = suspension packs down.","High-Speed Rebound: Controls extension after deep compressions to prevent the rear end from bucking on jumps.",u.p,u.p,u.p,"Volume Spacers: Alter bottom-out resistance. More tokens = harder to bottom out.","Hydraulic Bottom-Out: Extra hydraulic resistance at the very end of the stroke.","Off The Top: Regulates initial stroke sensitivity without affecting mid/end stroke.","The stiffness of the coil spring, chosen based on rider weight.","Coil spring preload. Warning: Do not use to adjust sag (max 2-3 turns)!"],t.li)
B.RO=new A.bk(B.x_,[B.RV,B.wG],t.vb)
